<figure class="cache-figure" data-invalidation-delivery>
 <p class="figure-title">A committed change needs a durable delivery obligation</p>
 <label><input type="checkbox" data-durable checked /> Record an outbox event in the source transaction</label>
 <div class="delivery-flow"><div><small>Source record</small><strong data-source>£12</strong></div><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><div><small data-record-label>Durable outbox</small><strong data-pending>Empty</strong></div><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><div data-cache-card><small>Redis copy</small><strong data-cache>£12</strong></div></div>
 <p class="figure-note">Writer process: <b data-process>running</b> · completed deliveries: <b data-deliveries>0</b></p>
 <div class="cache-controls"><button data-action="commit">Commit £15</button><button data-action="crash">Crash writer</button><button data-action="restart">Restart writer</button><button data-action="deliver">Deliver invalidation</button><button data-action="read">Read price</button><button data-action="duplicate">Replay deletion</button><button data-action="expire">Expire copy</button><button data-reset>Reset</button></div>
 <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>Commit, crash, restart, then try delivery and a read. Repeat without the outbox. The source transaction and its durability are model assumptions; the writer-process crash does not lose the database. Other application processes can keep reading. No concurrent loader or automatic expiry is included; “Expire copy” isolates TTL repair.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import {outboxInitial,outboxStep} from '../../lib/caching/invalidation.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-invalidation-delivery]').forEach(root=>{
 const durable=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-durable]')!;let state=outboxInitial(durable.checked);const set=(n:string,v:string)=>{root.querySelector(`[data-${n}]`)!.textContent=v;};
 const render=()=>{set('source',`£${state.source}`);set('cache',state.cache===null?'Empty':`£${state.cache}`);set('pending',state.pending?'1 pending':'Empty');set('record-label',state.durable?'Durable outbox':'Process memory');set('process',state.online?'running':'stopped');set('deliveries',String(state.delivered));set('explanation',state.message);root.querySelector('[data-cache-card]')!.classList.toggle('key-wrong',state.cache!==null&&state.cache!==state.source);
 const disabled={commit:state.committed||!state.online,crash:!state.online,restart:state.online,deliver:!state.online||!state.pending,duplicate:!state.online||!state.delivered};for(const [action,value] of Object.entries(disabled))root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(`[data-action="${action}"]`)!.disabled=value;
 };
 root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state=outboxStep(state,b.dataset.action!);render();});const reset=()=>{state=outboxInitial(durable.checked);render();};durable.onchange=reset;root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.onclick=reset;render();
});
</script>
